note Converted Key.yml | paths./key.get.security | only the first security requirement's first scheme, `keyHeader`, is used
note Dropped Cookie.yml | paths./cookie.get.security | `keyCookie` is a `apiKey` in `cookie` scheme, which is not imported, so no auth was set
